"Rynez-yt is the Artonan wizard who runs the Chicago House of Healing."
"He was the old boss of Alden Thorn's mother, a nurse there."
"He healed Alden after the Body Drainer incident."
"He is morose, with a dreadful bedside manner."
"Alden's mother Leah was fond of Rynez-yt and proud to work there."
"In the Matadero crisis Rynez-yt fetched Aunt Connie for evacuation at Alden's request."
